# DevOps Agentic Development Platform - Templates

This directory contains templates for all documentation, infrastructure, and automation artifacts.

## Structure
- `docs/` — Documentation templates (Mermaid diagrams, ADRs)
- `api/` — API templates (OpenAPI specs, Pydantic models)
- `docker/` — Docker Compose snippets, Dockerfiles
- `kubernetes/` — K8s manifests and Helm chart templates
- `github-actions/` — CI/CD workflow templates
- `scripts/` — Reusable shell/Python scripts
